  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{NO}=7 \\mathrm{e}^{-}$Incomplete octet with\n$\\mathrm{NO}_2=7 \\mathrm{e}^{-} \\int \\quad$ odd electron\n$\\left.\\begin{array}{l}\\mathrm{BCl}_3=6 \\mathrm{e}^{-} \\\\ \\mathrm{AlCl}_3=6 \\mathrm{e}^{-}\\end{array}\\right\\}$Incomplete octet\n$\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{SO}_4=12 \\mathrm{e}^{-}, \\mathrm{PCl}_5=10 \\mathrm{e}^{-} \\Rightarrow$ molecules with expanded octet\n$\\mathrm{CCl}_4=8 \\mathrm{e}^{-}, \\mathrm{CO}_2=8 \\mathrm{e}^{-} \\Rightarrow$ molecules obeying octet rule",
